ⳃⳘⳃⳀⳆ ⳘⳢⲴⳢ⳧ ⳁ ⳎⳜⲴⲴ⳥ⳜⳂⳜⳄⲼⳖⳒⳀⳊⳒ⳾ ⳐⲶⳤⳈⲾ⳾ⳀⲲⳲⳆⳚⳎ ⳁⲲ⳩ⳈⲴⳫⳎ⳹ⳀⳖ ⳞⳲⳔⳠⲾ⳾ⳒⳈⳔⲲⳲⳄ⳪ⳔⳃⳖⳢ⳪ⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1395.4,"y":1122.5,"cell":107004,"i":362,"name":"Muoholowa Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༵༡༣༰༗༯༰༠༁༠༷༮༉༢༛༣༻༡༸༆༷༵༰༫༹༳༘༔༣༦༺༦༃༰༘༸༖༘༸༈༺༨༺༯༐༵༙༯༛༲༄༢༧༊༩༣༺༿༿༱༪༉༑༃༂༌༮༒༸༿༼༦༣༇༷༥༵༄༊༊༼༊༦༴༦༆༈༴༣༜་༂༦༣༿༭༉༒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":146.67,"y":513.24,"cell":56528,"i":363,"name":"Yumi Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༖༡༴༃༳༅༄༪༆༾༗༹༴༂༤༰༠༄༅༩༕༹༩༮༶༩་༚༰༊༂༣༚༭༜༑༹༼༮༔༢༆༡༻༻༘༲༭༐༪༣༃༇༚</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1163.29,"y":377.53,"cell":30840,"i":364,"name":"Sinztalrech Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢒ᠐ᡓᢠᡑᢦᠮᢠᡜᠲᠾᢐᠾᢀᢞᢡᠮᡞᠼᡁᡰᠼᡀᡀᡀᡕᠰᡰᡞᢐᡏᡙᢤᢜᠦᠪᡯᠨᢋᢦᡍᢁᠦᠨᡮᡀᢛᡱᢂᢁᡓᠯᠪᡰᠦᡎᡝᡭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":570.7,"y":1101.8,"cell":104718,"i":365,"name":"Waruaba Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⲺⳔⳌⳀⳲ⳪ⳫⳀⳀ⳥ⳎⳈⳈⳚⳒⳀⲸⳖ⳥⳧ⳄⳬⳈ ⳊⳤⳊⳊⳞⳎⳒⳂ⳪ⳞⲲⳈⳆⳈⲾ ⳀⳞⳲ⳧⳾ⲶⳫⳚⳃⳭ  ⳩ⳃⲶⳎⳌⳃⳢⳎ  ⲶⳞⳁⲾⲸⳫⳔⳌⳃⲶⳊⳆⳊ⳾ⳀⳌⳐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1745.47,"y":455.34,"cell":46666,"i":366,"name":"Vellyth Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༚༵༜༂༵༌༄༜༃༭༈༷༙༘༗༓༴༥༛༈༆༵༮༑༛༶༸༃༹༷༣༼༧༡ༀ༫༘༲༓༸༣༣༆༂ༀ༲༪༑༒༪༂༢༐༷༾༣༮༮༿༗༖༔༚༦༪༢༮༌༤༽༪༗༔་༅་༦༓༤༈༪༯༶༁</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":922.31,"y":435.39,"cell":42688,"i":367,"name":"Guildling Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༡༸༩༄༰༂༠༈༊༹༳༵༔༲༸༬༌༱༑༾༖༺༢༩༔༽༄༺༨༵༦༦༿༁༮༵༐༆༂༤༼༮༭༇༴༦༴༉༈༅༸༪༤༸༻༤༹༵༖</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":618.8,"y":147.1,"cell":3251,"i":368,"name":"Namje Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢒᡲᢓᡕᢤᡜᠻᢑ᠒ᡱᠰᠻᠭᡳᢛᡯᠭᡁᡟᢀ᠒ᡱᢜᡕᠼᠰᡟᢑᢐᠡᠠᢋᠳᡮᠧᢟᢡᡲᡗᡔᡝᡰᢒᢂ᠑ᡴᠻᢥᢜᢢ᠒ᠵᢐᢥᠩᢁᢓᢠᡔᠵᠻᠦᡐᡔᡐᡐᢢᢏᠽᠱᢒᡮᠱᠭᠦ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":97.5,"y":909.72,"cell":86488,"i":369,"name":"Bac An Chau Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc17\udc13𐠲 \udc13\udc2d\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc2a\ud802\ud802𐠏\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠸𐠑\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc28\udc0e\ud802𐠸\udc01\udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc34\ud802𐠄𐠊𐠫\udc10\ud802𐠁 𐠛\udc0c\udc2a\udc30\udc37\udc28\udc2c\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":95.44,"y":917.48,"cell":87004,"i":370,"name":"Nga Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802 \udc3f𐠐𐠯\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc08\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠵\udc34\ud802 \ud802𐠋\udc02\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc04\udc27𐠃𐠄\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1578.22,"y":263.38,"cell":14051,"i":371,"name":"Sordaldal Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃⳞⳁⳜⳆⳒⳔ⳥ⳢⳞⲼⲲ ⳫⳠⳞⳀⳈⳞⳎⲺⳎ⳾Ⳋⳁ⳥Ⲻ⳪Ⳝⳤ⳪Ⳬ  ⳄⲶⳐⳬ ⳧ⳒⳘ⳹ⳁⳬⳄ⳾⳩ⳜⳠ⳩ⳐⳞ⳾Ⳟ⳾ⳀⳜⳂⳤⳖⲼⳆⳁⳂⳌⲾⳊⳭ⳥ⳘⳠⳜ ⳬⳊⳒⳲⳄ ⲺⲲⳐ⳹ⳞⲺⳫⳜⲾⳔⳐ⳾ⳄⲸⳁⲲⳞⲶ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1567.16,"y":370.95,"cell":29910,"i":372,"name":"Bener Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༂༰༈༴༛༿༯༛༸༥༉༘ༀ༧༽༥༚༷༦༃༰༴༯༅༄༐༩༥༼༧༆༈༶༠༰༿༑༊༇༙༔༳༨༷༽༌༹༆༉༴༸༷༌༲༚༁༌༘༻༗</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":250.86,"y":404.96,"cell":36441,"i":373,"name":"Kikatano Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠞𐠊𐠋\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc08\udc16𐠿\ud802𐠨\udc23\ud802\ud802 \udc25𐠸\ud802\ud802𐠩𐠕𐠧\udc34\udc34\udc3c\udc14\udc25\udc01\ud802 \udc25𐠘𐠚𐠗\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠿𐠲\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc05 \ud802𐠚 \ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":439.25,"y":841.25,"cell":82288,"i":374,"name":"Klakknes Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༄༽༨༦༮༛༼༤༻༭༌༇༗༸༺༁༯༓༣༽༴༶༠༄༜༠༻༜༬༿༓༭༺༜༛༸༪༱༁༷༬༜༌༾༶༔༡༊༮༥༤༙༳༒༇༥༶༁༂༥༣༘༿༙༖༸༱་༤༙༲༰</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1255.3,"y":541.1,"cell":60687,"i":375,"name":"Casca Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᡓᡐᡓᡐᠡᠭᡒ᠐᠒ᢟᠩᠱᡍᢜᢏᢋᡟ᠀ᠪᢢ᠀ᢢᢤᢓᢜᡁᠵᡁᢦᠲᡡᠿᠱᡐᡴᢀ᠐ᠡᠱᠧᢡᡯᠩᡞᡴᡡ᠀ᡎᢓᡰᠱᢂᠳᡰᠻᠼᠰᢜᢑᢂᡖᠰᠦᡴᠿᠮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1494.5,"y":409.47,"cell":37407,"i":376,"name":"Bolburg Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1b\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802𐠍\udc0c\udc08\udc34\udc0f\udc34\udc20\udc10\udc0d𐠃\udc2d\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802 𐠱𐠅\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc0b\udc20\udc10\ud802𐠜𐠔𐠭\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝𐠊\udc1a\udc03\ud802𐠡\udc1a\udc13\udc2c \ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠋\ud802𐠣\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1567.31,"y":461.7,"cell":48131,"i":377,"name":"Mobeth Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༙༿༰༈༔༸༦༇༰༨༨༑༑༌༸༃༘༓༊༔༾༐༴༂༧༢༄༣༌༩༭༮༄༪ༀ༾༣༭༭༂་༩༮༩༜༑ༀ༣༹༕༢༪༉༩༙༒༑༴༈༤༄༩༗༭༘༾༕༆༘༾༻༦་༬༯༃༰༖</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1368.29,"y":600.73,"cell":68637,"i":378,"name":"Schen Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1b\udc2a\udc2e\udc3c\ud802\ud802𐠜 𐠒𐠋\udc19\udc26𐠯\udc03\udc1f\udc03\ud802𐠢\udc14𐠚\ud802𐠎𐠠 \udc1b\udc18\udc3f 𐠼\ud802𐠐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1594.24,"y":514.81,"cell":57295,"i":379,"name":"Yagithmordor Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2c\udc31\udc01\udc18𐠎\udc1e\udc0c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc11\udc01\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc13 \ud802 \udc0e\ud802𐠛𐠬 \ud802𐠃𐠲\ud802 \udc31\ud802𐠞𐠨\udc0b\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":416.17,"y":901.95,"cell":86111,"i":380,"name":"Rusheemen Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢤᠳᢋᡒᡴᡠᡠᠻᠯᠰ᠑ᠭᢋᡡᠰᡠᢋᠩᢥᡓᡱᠮᡲᡏᢑᡍᠱᡕᠯᢏᢟᡁᡏᡭᢡᢐᡲ᠐ᠨᡳᠾᡠᡑᡑᡆᠧᠽᢤᠲᡓᠭᢑᠽᢋᡯᡓᡟᢏᢠᡜᠦᢜᢡᡐᡆᡐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1383.84,"y":158.39,"cell":4437,"i":381,"name":"Egoerlussuaq Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ወፀአነአቀተሀመአጸነሠመጰከሐፀደ ከሐዘፀፀተዐየጸዐየተጠሀሀረየቀረለ ገሐኀ ኀተበለሀ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":372.1,"y":1145.55,"cell":109164,"i":382,"name":"Abdeiapala Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳫⳬⳤⳲⳒⳠⳭⳊⳤ⳧ⳲⳄⲴ⳹ⳈⳫ  Ⲻ⳹⳩ⳚⲶⲾⳒⳂⳐⳒⳆⳜⳲⲴⳃⲼⲶⳐ ⳌⳘⳆⳘ ⳧ⲲⳒⳠⳌⳖⳞⲸ ⳁⳐ ⳘⲶⲾⳢⲸⳖⳎⳬⳆⳖⲲⲾⳲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":500.58,"y":1056.95,"cell":99917,"i":383,"name":"Adanadur Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳢⲶⳁ⳹ⳤⳘⲲⲸⳃⳁⳌ   ⳖⲶⳔ ⳆⳊⲺⳭⳒⲲⳆ⳩ⳂⳀ⳪ⲲⳆⳐⳎⳲⳔⳆⳜⲸⳀⳎⳈⳃⳠⳘⳁⳤⲾ ⳀⳎ ⳪ⳠⳞⳫⳒⳢⳁ⳥ⳫⲾ⳩Ⲽ⳥ⳠⳀ⳩ⳠⳒⳠⳤ ⳧Ⳋ ⳩⳩ⲶⳫ ⳠⳞⲸⲸⳔⲺ⳪⳾ⳭⳈⳞ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":388.43,"y":1042.75,"cell":98493,"i":384,"name":"Bosloraten Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳚⳒ  ⳀⳚⲴⲶⲶⳈ ⳩ⳃ⳹ⲴⳁⲴⳢⳆⲶⳒⳀⳊⲴⳬⳫ ⲲⳲⳄⳠⳜⳤⳖⳤⳄⳎ⳹ ⳤⳐⳒⳊⳄⲲⲶⳆⳖ Ⳙ⳧ⳠⲼⲶⳢⳈⳀ⳪ⲲⳲ ⳾⳧Ⳣ⳪ⲸⳎ  ⳒⳘⳃⳤⳜⳞⲶⳞ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":264.26,"y":558.08,"cell":63124,"i":385,"name":"Yazhou Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳂ⳥ⳠⳈⲾⳞⳄⳊ⳹ⳤⳬⳚⲸⳜⳜⳘⳌⲺⲼⳲⳆ⳪ⳜⳐⳀ⳥ ⳊⳔⳁ⳥Ⳮ⳥ⳢⲺⳎⳒⳄⳭⳌⳤⳈ ⳤⳀ ⳢⳂⲺⲶⳠⳐⲼ⳪ⳬⳤ Ⳇ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":795.03,"y":640.91,"cell":72945,"i":386,"name":"Tlaltepahuat Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢐᡀᡭᢁᢐᡞᡓᢒᠯᠲᢒᡍᠵᢛᡲᢠᡮᢡᠠᡙᠼᠽᡝᡭᠿᢒᡆᡝᡖᢑᡠᠨᡟᠯᢒᢡᡆᠲᡙᠽᡁᢓᢁᠿᡲᠦᠪᡝᡓᢦ᠐ᡐᢐᡮᡟᢂᠮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":117.31,"y":534.75,"cell":59707,"i":387,"name":"Taoqing Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢛᡲᡭ᠑ᡍᡎᠼᢞᡏᡒ᠑ᡁᡐᢐᠰᠨᡜᡜᠭᢞᢥ᠑ᡀᡯᠱᡀᡓ᠑᠑ᠾᡐᠭᢛ᠒ᢟᢀᡗᡆᡝᡍᠿᠵᡲᡲᢡᡠᡱᡭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":801.2,"y":692.7,"cell":77004,"i":388,"name":"Cocatlan Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹ⳚⳂⳔⳬⳲⳂⳢⳂⲴⳐⳠⳖⳭⳞⲺⳀⲴⳒⲸⳄⳎⳔ⳹ⳐⲸⳊⳌ⳧ⳐⳞⲸⳔⳠ⳩ⳤⳭⳫⳜⳠⳢⳁⳔ⳾Ⲽⳤ⳾ⳆⳒⳊⲸ Ⳉ⳹ⳢⳄⳁ⳹ⳌⲾⲾⳈⳀⳈⲺⳚ⳹ⲲⳈⳐⳆⲾ ⳚⳂⲴⳠⳖⳠⳊⳜⳞⳀⳭⳀⳘⲸⳔⳠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":480.53,"y":253.06,"cell":12814,"i":389,"name":"Sanghwan Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠔\udc17\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc26𐠫\ud802𐠸\ud802𐠃\udc19\udc0d\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc0f \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc04𐠌\udc34𐠢\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠔 \udc05\udc2c\udc14\udc2d 𐠷\udc0d\udc25\ud802\ud802𐠔𐠭\udc02\ud802𐠙\udc15\ud802𐠭\udc33 \udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc19\ud802\ud802𐠼\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠮</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1607.34,"y":360.15,"cell":27725,"i":390,"name":"Caldra Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༢༕༶༠༠༂༉༷༅༾༾༫ༀ༔༴༆༒༃༖༺༇༵༸༲༪༓༓༻༠༦༜༓༇༸༢༦༶༯༦༇༡༴༦༱༽༉༶༡༪༫༫༹༈༥༗༹༱ༀ༹༌༖༯༜༖༴༒༔༿༛༕༔༨༘༵༳༡༧༉༺༚༪༻༬༡༇༴༱༌༛་༃༌༼</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":978.7,"y":595.53,"cell":68010,"i":391,"name":"Ymlarlon Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠሰደአዘቀሀ ረፈነገዐመነረገዐጰቀወዘጰፈደሀሐተለከረጠ ዐረነመጠሰአኀረከረነጸሐ ከ ጰሐጠጸደጰዘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":457.5,"y":799.9,"cell":80398,"i":392,"name":"Mosbernes Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤ ⳁⳀⳆⳐ⳩⳧ⲺⳢⳒⲶⳆ Ⲽ ⳤⳜⳢⳔ ⳥ⳎⲺⳂⳒⳆⳊⳤ⳾ⲴⲶⳂⳲⳘⳄ ⳜⳢⳌⳚⳢ⳥ⲼⳢⳬ Ⳇ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":437.02,"y":255.25,"cell":13044,"i":393,"name":"Holingai Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸጠለፐለሠገጠ ከዘሐለጠ ሠደ ሰፐአአዘሀበአዐሀዘፐፈጸተከ ጰበየመኀሐነከጸረነኀኀ  መመበደጸጠየበዐተአደኀነሀአሠ   ኀገየ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1546.17,"y":624.99,"cell":71393,"i":394,"name":"Zrulzug Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⳌⲴⳒ⳩ⳐⳖⳜⳬⳎⳄ⳾⳥⳩Ⳡ ⲸⲸⳄⲶⲶⳲⲼⳬ ⳆⳢⳫⲶⲺⳲⳁⳭⳬ⳧ⲴⳲⳤ   ⳪ⲼⳖⳞ Ⳡ ⳪ⳠⳀⲸ⳾Ⳃ⳹⳹ⳘⳂⳆ⳥⳾</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1584.19,"y":1107.77,"cell":105486,"i":395,"name":"Kainauila Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \udc0c\udc20\udc0c\udc24\udc0e𐠬\udc12𐠨\udc26\udc2d𐠚\ud802𐠓\udc22\udc2d\udc12\udc10\udc35𐠗𐠖𐠈\ud802 \ud802𐠃\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc2f\udc1e\ud802𐠦\udc28\udc1b\udc2c\udc23\udc37𐠲\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠒\ud802 \udc04\udc0f𐠟𐠧\ud802\ud802𐠢\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1485.98,"y":362.26,"cell":28222,"i":396,"name":"Optenkirchen Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> 𐠤\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠸\udc33\ud802  \ud802𐠘\udc27\udc0f\ud802𐠎\udc01 \udc32𐠣\udc2f\ud802𐠑\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc30\ud802𐠪 \ud802𐠍\udc02𐠓\udc35\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":872.63,"y":406.45,"cell":36608,"i":397,"name":"Marshfield Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༁༯༗༔༽༣༛༱༴༼༮༸༠༹༉༊༮༑༔༛༕༾༷༬༫༜༃༽༆༄༓༽༘༆༊༗༚༖༃༭༅༄༜༅༜༿༇༊༃༩༓༴༥༚༅༽༚༷༃༖༺༨༈༉༯༘༼༮༯༱༶༗༆༫༓༢༤༅༠༫༾༂༕༌༛༫༂༾༷</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":342.76,"y":1079.76,"cell":101957,"i":398,"name":"Arathympo Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳃ ⳬ⳧Ⳟ⳩ⳬⲲⳲⳜⲼⳊ⳧ⳎⳈⳊⳀⳲⳲⲾ⳹ⳆⳭⳄⳒⳭⳄⳂⳖⳞⲴⳫⳜⳐⳀⳭⲶⲲⳘⳜ ⳩ⳀⲲ ⳢⳭⳘⳃⳠⲾⳐ⳪ⲸⳆ⳥⳥⳹ⳈⲸⳃⲶ⳾ⳔⲶⳚⳂⳤ⳾Ⳡ⳧Ⲳⳃⳤ⳩ⳚⳜ⳾ⳁⳜⳞⲼⳠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":242.53,"y":1072.66,"cell":101358,"i":399,"name":"Mymaratria Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠃\udc20\udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc1b\ud802𐠪\udc38\udc05\udc34\udc1f\udc27\udc20𐠂\ud802𐠂\ud802\ud802 𐠲 \udc0d𐠣𐠕𐠿\udc14\udc1d𐠂\udc1e\ud802𐠮 \udc0b\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫𐠚\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc0d\ud802𐠦𐠞\udc29\udc27𐠴\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠁𐠲𐠑 𐠝\udc35\udc2d\ud802𐠼\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":365,"y":1013.47,"cell":94913,"i":400,"name":"Nana Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0e\udc35\ud802𐠓\udc1b\ud802 \udc33\udc28𐠏\udc0c\udc1c\udc37\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛\udc01𐠢 \udc2e𐠨\udc32\ud802𐠭\udc33\udc34\ud802𐠥𐠢\ud802𐠮\ud802𐠞\udc22𐠴\udc22\udc15\udc16\udc31 𐠫\udc02𐠍\udc08\udc14𐠍\udc16\udc1c\udc18\ud802𐠝\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1296.58,"y":580.28,"cell":66251,"i":401,"name":"Callano Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠿᢟᢁᡯᡠᢏᠯᢦᠻᢛᡮᡭᡁᢂᡔᡟᡒᡙᠽᡜᢟᢑᠲᡟᡳᠲᡝᡏᠳᢀᢡᡍᠡᡗᢀᠨᠿᢀᢢᡭᢓᡒᢛ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1548.69,"y":295.54,"cell":17730,"i":402,"name":"Huskela Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳬⲲⲸⳐⳄⳊ ⳾Ⳋ ⳚⳚⲲ ⳬ⳾⳾ⳆⳞⳬⳃⳐⳔⲼⲲⳃⳫⳘⳄ ⳹ⳆⲶⲴⳔⲺⳚⳀ⳪ⲺⲼⳬ⳧⳾ⳈⳁⳀⳢⳌⲾⲴⳄⳆⲼⳊⳆⳁ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1311.57,"y":372.72,"cell":30356,"i":403,"name":"Lauserngen Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᢤᡔᠦᠽᢤᠯᠭᢑᠼᡏᠵ᠐ᢤᢛᡱᠻᠽᡰᡑᠪᠼᠿᡞᠼ᠑ᡜᠡᡔᠲᢜᡐᡜᢑᢋᡖᠵᡕᠱᡀ᠀ᢠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1431.94,"y":486.65,"cell":52398,"i":404,"name":"Onautertal Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc13\udc15\udc1f𐠜\udc11\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc2d \udc10\udc34𐠢𐠌\ud802\ud802 𐠢𐠙\udc12\udc1d𐠜 \ud802𐠋𐠐𐠊\udc18\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠛\udc14\udc17\udc15\udc01𐠤\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc21\udc14</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":759.97,"y":655.38,"cell":74178,"i":405,"name":"Yecoyapaxco Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc05𐠩𐠫 \ud802𐠟 \udc29𐠮\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802𐠨\ud802𐠄\udc21\ud802 𐠷\udc0f  𐠚\udc27\ud802𐠫𐠵 \udc13\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc28\ud802𐠂\udc0b\udc0a𐠥𐠷\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc38\udc14\udc2e\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc17\udc04 \udc13\ud802𐠧\udc14\udc1d\ud802𐠿𐠰\udc01\udc24\ud802𐠫𐠤\udc10𐠼\udc24</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1271.27,"y":473.37,"cell":50025,"i":406,"name":"Wiegengen Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༉༓༊༕༼༛༻༧༮༻༨༽༠༌༧༴༆༂༆༑༹༹༄༦༙༜༃༸༁༖༤༕༲༊༶༆༡༅༿༿༜༢༧༇༯༕༶༼་༯༳༆༸༆༮༂༐༡༠༬༪༐༇ༀ༵༯༅༈༔༁༷༈༠༣༶༪༫༳༨༁༊༬</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":556.54,"y":1131.54,"cell":108055,"i":407,"name":"Lodhara Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደፐሠሐረለኀፈጰወሐደነጰጸጰሰደበሠአከዐዘሐጸጰፐሐከዐፀ ተሀሐሀጰደለሠደፈኀአለደአፐገፈሰቀጠጰገጠፈመፐ  ፈ መወ ኀሀገአረፐፈ መ  ፈደከሰአረጠሐአበፈተየመበጰመተፀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":374.67,"y":496.96,"cell":53953,"i":408,"name":"Chilundak Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠡᡟᡠᡓᡁᡐᠡᢦᢐᠾᡭᡲᡖᠰᠻᡜᡑᡰᡕᡒᠦᢢᡐᠳᡱᡱᢁᢦᠠᠿᠯ᠐᠐ᡮᡰᠠᡜᢢᡗᡗᡴᠭᢓᢥᡗᢤᡔᠰᠨ᠐ᡟᡒᡳᡮᡭᢂᠼᡮᢟᢐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":799,"y":665.26,"cell":75148,"i":409,"name":"Toyacoya Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but